  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Interim Facility seeks to minimize disruptions and loss of hard-earned gains in institutional and productive capacity namely:1) Improved trade environment conducive for inclusive and sustainable growth of the LDCs; and2) Increased exports and access to international markets for the LDCs.</narrative>
  </description>
